### Content summary (PDCA, from check + KS sources)

- **Purpose:** Metrics-phase `colorOnlyReport` flags color-only encoding in data contexts (`MIN_COLOR_LABEL_CHARS` = 2): missing `.ks-swatch-label`, legend swatches without row text, empty table cells with meaningful `background-color`.
